  "description": "eBikes are fast becoming a popular choice for riders looking to get there faster, with less effort. Leave the car behind and avoid the need for public transport – riding an Ebike each day gives you more of the things you love about riding a bike, and will make you want to do it more often. We deliver you the ultimate eBike commuter, powered by the latest Shimano Steps systems.\n\nWith the new Urban range, Reid and Shimano Steps deliver a sleek and cleverly designed Ebike package to answer all the challenges of riding around your city or heading out on touring adventures. Designed for a modern, understated look and powered by the latest Shimano Steps E5000 Series mid-mount electric motor system, these eBikes are ready to go.\nEbikes use a battery powered motor to give you pedal-assistance up to 25km/hr to help you ride further, with less effort so you can get there faster and in better shape.",
